        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Swiss state of the art technology\n\n# Included processes\nInventory for construction and operation of the traffic area (roads and parking) on company sites. The inventory includes processes for the supply of used materials such as gravel and bitumen . NMVOC emissions from bitumen are included. Transport of materials to the constructions site has been taken into account. Also, de-icing with sodium chlorid is accounted for. Energy cosumption due to lighting is excluded as well as weed control and marking.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
